==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card is almost identical to {{TCG ID|Silver Tempest|Dewpider|47}} from the {{TCG|Silver Tempest}} expansion, except for the {{TCG|Weakness}} modifier.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Dewpider|48}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
*'''Hook''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Dragon|Magnemite|61}} from the {{TCG|EX Dragon}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

